ker wedges feature a stepped shaft design combined with a non-slip grip that greatly reduces vibration and provides accurate feedback at impact. This ensures you feel confident with every swing<div></div>  - MICRO-MILLED CLUBFACEdelivers excellent spin, control and stability whether in the fairway, on the fringe or on the green. Use 3 clubs around the green instead of one<div></div>  - PROFESSIONAL QUALITY AT A GREAT VALUEOur right-handed bunker wedges are crafted with top-of-the-line manufacturing techniques and designed for the average golfer, weekend warrior, or amateur golfer like you, offering high-end performance at an affordable price to enhance your short game</div></div></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div><table><tbody><tr><td style=\"height:10px\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div></center><center><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src='data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+ip1sAAAAASUVORK5CYII=' data-src=\"https://gi.esmplus.com/epep5524/%ED%95%98%EB%8B%A8.png\"  style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto\" /></div></center><span></span>",
